OL,3,GNEWSABalaclava ban aims to address
OL,4,A'substantial' problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FOffenders wearing balaclavas to hide
OL,7,Ftheir identity cause "substantial"
OL,8,Fproblems in Nottingham, a police chief
OL,9,Fhas said as a new ban came into force
OL,10,Fin the city.
OL,12,FNottingham has become one of the first
OL,13,Fcities in the UK to introduce
OL,14,Frestrictions on balaclavas, allowing
OL,15,Fpolice and community protection
OL,16,Fofficers to ask people to remove them
OL,17,Fif they "reasonably believe" they are
OL,18,Fbeing used to conceal their identity to
OL,19,Fcommit crime or anti-social behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
