OL,3,GNEWSABalaclava ban aims to address
OL,4,A'substantial' problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnyone who refuses to comply could face
OL,7,Fa #70 fixed penalty notice or be
OL,8,Fprosecuted, with courts able to impose
OL,9,Fa maximum fine of #1,000.
OL,11,FSupt Chris Pearson said an "awful lot
OL,12,Fof people" described being intimidated
OL,13,Fby balaclavas.
